==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Easter B.B.Bunny]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage, just bring the Normal Cats to beat it.

==Trivia==
*This stage is an exact copy of [[Season of Rebirth]].

